Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:26.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.83,0:00:31.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since I've had that dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:40.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lord Hiraku!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:42.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.54,0:00:44.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I still haven't finished the morning chores...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.13,0:00:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. I woke up early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.58,0:00:50.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So anyways...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:53.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd really appreciate it if you\Nstopped calling me "lord".
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.46,0:00:55.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Very well...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.25,0:00:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:00:59.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.13,0:01:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:08.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was careless...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.25,0:01:10.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So you're working in the kitchen now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:13.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll just roast the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.71,0:01:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, cut him some slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.63,0:01:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.21,0:01:28.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're up early today, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:30.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I just woke up a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.83,0:01:32.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:36.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What're you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.54,0:01:40.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had to talk to Granmary about something\Nwhile she was on patrol duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:41.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:42.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.25,0:01:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She reported to me earlier\Nabout something, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.67,0:01:49.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:52.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.83,0:01:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just had a dream I haven't had in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.83,0:01:55.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.88,0:01:59.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's more like\Nan old memory than a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:34.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Back then, I really never could have imagined...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:43.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that I'd ever get to live such a dream of a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hiraku Machio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.13,0:04:20.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:22.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:24.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And, um... you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:26.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm the god who watches over this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:28.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're God?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:31.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, so I guess that means I finally died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:31.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.29,0:04:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to this world's calendar\Nyou've lived 39 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:37.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And what a cruel life it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:40.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were betrayed by others,\Nand then fell ill with a terminal disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.25,0:04:45.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I've decided to give you\Na chance at a second life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.79,0:04:47.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.50,0:04:48.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:52.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This time shall grant you\Na healthy body that won't fall ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:56.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You see, I consider it a mistake on my part
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:04:59.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that you were forced to live\Nsuch a cruel existence in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:00.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:03.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I ask that you take this act\Nas penance for my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:04.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.13,0:05:08.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it, but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.17,0:05:10.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's make sure to do this right.\NDo you have any requests?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.92,0:05:14.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll let you live your new life\Nthe way you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.25,0:05:15.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The way I want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.83,0:05:18.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can grant pretty much\Nany request you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:21.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:22.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to try my hand at farming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.46,0:05:23.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Farming?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:28.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I really enjoyed watching a show about farming\Nwhile I was stuck in the hospital bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.38,0:05:30.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was a show about idols farming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:34.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In my last life, I had a hard time\Ngetting along with other people,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I thought it would be nice\Nif I could live a laid-back life
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.13,0:05:40.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,of farming somewhere\Nwhere not many people go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:41.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that too much to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:44.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, it's just that farming\Nisn't part of my jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:45.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your jurisdiction?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:47.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But let's give him a call and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.21,0:05:50.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah! Hm? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:52.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:56.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll receive your new life and\Na healthy body with which to live it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:06:00.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In addition, I've received permission\Nfrom the god of agriculture
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.08,0:06:02.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to bestow upon you the power of\Nthe almighty farming tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:05.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The almighty farming tool?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.08,0:06:05.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.79,0:06:10.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your chance at a second life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:29.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My body can move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:34.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time\Nsince I've been able to move around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.58,0:06:36.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How many years has it been\Nsince I've been able to stand up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:41.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Having a healthy body is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.17,0:06:46.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright, I've come back to life\Nsafe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.17,0:06:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's time to start my second life...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:52.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the farming life that I wished for!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:02.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So this is where I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:07.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.50,0:07:09.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Forest as far as the eye can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.79,0:07:13.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know I asked for somewhere\Nthat not many people go,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.63,0:07:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but this almost feels like a place\Nthat people can't reach even if they want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh well. No use in complaining now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to think about what I can do from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.67,0:07:25.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm dressed like a villager from a video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:28.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I get the feeling that\NI'm younger than I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.67,0:07:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do I have anything I can actually use?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.17,0:07:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right! The almighty farming tool...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:43.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This must be magic power or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:50.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No matter how much I use this hoe,\NI don't get tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.04,0:07:53.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I can till the hard ground and\Ncut through tree roots without a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.88,0:07:56.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This soil's nice and fluffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.13,0:08:00.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can grow some great vegetables\Nin a field I till with this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.83,0:08:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to worry about finding\Nwater and food right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:10.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The forest goes on and on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:13.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I tried listening carefully so that I could\Nhear if any streams were nearby,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.75,0:08:15.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but all I could hear was\Nthe rustling of the leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.13,0:08:19.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Forget finding edible plants...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.25,0:08:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't even see any grass\Ngrowing around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.38,0:08:22.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Am I playing on the right difficulty setting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:28.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.46,0:08:31.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,there's a good chance that there could be\Ndangerous animals around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.92,0:08:34.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to hurry and find somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's one nice tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.71,0:08:47.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'll make a good landmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:49.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think I'll set up my base camp here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.38,0:08:57.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I walked around for a while, but there\Ndon't seem to be any rivers or ponds nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.25,0:08:59.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.00,0:09:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll dig a well!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:06.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I bet you're thinking that it's silly to try\Nto find water underground like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:11.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I've heard that people sometimes use\Nthis method to find water pipes. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:13.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't get this at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shovel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:18.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This almighty farming tool\Nreally lives up to its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.67,0:09:20.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It can turn into all kinds of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.54,0:09:20.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For the record, it can't turn into\Ncomplicated machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.79,0:09:21.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Excavator!\N{\rSubtitle}For the record, it can't turn into{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}complicated machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.79,0:09:23.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Uh, make something big and awesome!\N{\rSubtitle}For the record, it can't turn into{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}complicated machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:23.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Uh, make something big and awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.08,0:09:27.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just as I expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.25,0:09:29.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't get tired no matter\Nhow much I dig, just like the hoe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:32.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now I can dig forever until I hit water!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.17,0:09:36.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Am I stuck down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.71,0:09:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know... I'll dig diagonally!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I only just started digging...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:49.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's my lucky day!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, this might be another one\Nof God's blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.50,0:09:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that I've secured my source of water,\Nit's time to find food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:09:58.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was my plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.21,0:10:02.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but oddly enough, I don't feel hungry at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.17,0:10:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this is the power of\Nthe almighty farming tool, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:09.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's probably dangerous to go\Nwandering through the forest again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:10.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Scythe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.25,0:10:13.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Since I'm definitely going to turn this\Ninto my base of operations,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:16.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll keep working on building it up\Nwith the almighty farming tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:19.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'd be nice if I found something to eat\Nwhile I was working here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.21,0:10:22.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything around here. Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:28.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to cultivate the land here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:30.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,this tree is going to be\Nin the way eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.96,0:10:34.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks like a pretty sturdy tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.21,0:10:37.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but maybe if I turn the almighty farming tool\Ninto an axe, I can cut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.00,0:10:40.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think the right way is\Nto start cutting one side,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.00,0:10:42.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and then go in from\Nthe other side with the axe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:44.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:46.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.88,0:10:48.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll start from this side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:50.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:54.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:06.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I cut it clean in two with one swing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.75,0:11:09.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This almighty farming tool is something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.17,0:11:11.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hatchet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.42,0:11:14.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Since I've already cut it down,\NI should try to process it down into lumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.21,0:11:16.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll start by cutting off the branches,\Nthen I'll cut the trunk up into logs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then I'll strip the bark off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm cutting through the sturdy tree\Nlike it's a block of cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:25.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So about this hook-like tool\Nthat I'm using to drag the tree around...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.75,0:11:27.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what it's called, but apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:30.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can turn the almighty farming tool\Ninto anything I can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.04,0:11:34.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now I've got myself some lumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:36.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Based on the farming sim games\NI used to play,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.83,0:11:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,this is about the time I should start\Nbuilding small hut out of the lumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.83,0:11:43.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it's not going to be easy to build\Nthe parts for the walls and roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.25,0:11:46.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plus, I don't have any nails or\Nadhesive to stick them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.13,0:11:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Building a hut from scratch\Nis pretty tough, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.67,0:11:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:54.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This pillar I stuck in the ground for fun\Nis casting a shadow almost like a sun dial...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.17,0:11:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:59.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was having so much fun\Nthat I lost track of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:01.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The sun's about to set\Nand then it's going to be night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.38,0:12:03.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And what happens then?!\NIt's going to be dark out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.63,0:12:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need some kind of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.83,0:12:06.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flashlight! Lamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.71,0:12:08.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No good. I'll need to start a fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:10.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lighter! Matches!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.33,0:12:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:13.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe this has something to do with that\Njurisdiction issue God was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, the thought of turning\Nthe almighty farming tool into a match
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.29,0:12:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,only for it to burn away\Nand be lost forever is scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:20.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need something that can create heat\Nwithout burning itself away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:22.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:23.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnifying glass!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.29,0:12:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can start a fire with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:29.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or rather, I could have if it was daytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.25,0:12:36.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I ended up quickly carving a hole\Ninto the tree's trunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:38.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I'd have some kind of shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:41.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought about digging a hole in the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:44.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but the thought of accidentally burying myself\Nalive scared me so I gave up on the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:47.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This chisel is another form of\Nthe almighty farming tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:53.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks like it'll take a lot of trial and error\Nbefore I can make furniture or a hut.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.29,0:12:57.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was worried I wouldn't be able\Nto see when it was dark out,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.33,0:12:59.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I'm surprised at how well\NI can still see at nighttime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:03.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because when God granted me\Na healthy body, my vision improved as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.75,0:13:05.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's because of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.71,0:13:09.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The two moons casting light.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.88,0:13:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:15.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I really am in another world, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.54,0:13:26.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did a lot of trial and error trying to\Nfigure out how to work with the lumber,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.29,0:13:28.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and before I knew it, morning had come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks like I'll be fine\Nin terms of having water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.33,0:13:41.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right!\NI need to do that before I forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.63,0:13:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And now I have a fire going, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.46,0:13:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From there, I continued clearing the area\Nso that I could cultivate the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.75,0:13:58.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't get tired or hungry\Nwhile using the almighty farming tool,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.75,0:14:02.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure that doing this kind of work\Nis using up some of my body's stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:05.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even specks of dust can pile up\Nto make mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.17,0:14:09.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In other words, I think it's finally time\Nfor me to eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.38,0:14:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It might be time to change gears
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:13.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and go look for food somewhere\Nfurther away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.33,0:14:20.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what is that thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:29.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, that was a happy accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.25,0:14:32.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It had scary fangs and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:38.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All it took was one blow to the neck\Nwith the almighty farming tool's hoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:42.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I tilled the giant rabbit's head\Nand turned it into nice a fluffy soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.96,0:14:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then I turned the almighty farming tool into\Na knife and used it to take apart the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.63,0:14:50.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At least I'll be able to make use of its body\Nto feed myself. I'm thankful for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:51.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grilled rabbit...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:55.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It tastes very natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.33,0:14:57.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or rather, it tastes gamey and bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:15:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm grateful that I have\Nsomething to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:04.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What goes in must also come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.54,0:15:06.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The next thing I built was a toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.58,0:15:09.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The toilet seat was made from a log.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:11.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Below that, I dug a hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:17.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now I can relax and take care of my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:25.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't relax at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I put to use some of the building technology\NI developed instead of sleeping last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.38,0:15:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It ended up being better built\Nthan where I slept last night, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.46,0:15:36.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A toilet that's comfortable to use\Nis necessary for any sort of civilized lifestyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:43.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I took a bunch of detours getting here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:45.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I've finally started cultivating the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.08,0:15:49.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What should I grow\Nto help support my life here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:51.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll need stuff that preserves well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.54,0:15:52.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Potatoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:53.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Onions?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:55.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Some tomatoes and cucumbers would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can eat those as is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.88,0:15:59.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cabbage and spinach.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.29,0:16:01.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Daikon. Napa. Carrots.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.71,0:16:04.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I want to eat some boiled corn, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:08.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've realized something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:13.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even if I cultivate the land,\NI have no seeds or seedlings to plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.54,0:16:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess my only option is to head\Ninto the forest to look for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:20.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I went to bed on a stomach full of rabbit meat
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:21.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and when I woke up the next morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,my eyes opened in surprise when they saw this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:30.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can the plants in this world grow\Neven if you don't plant their seeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.33,0:16:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or could this be because of\Nthe almighty farming tool?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.04,0:16:34.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are sprouts popping up in every row.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:36.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And it only took one night!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:40.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But these sprouts look different\Nthan the plants I'm used to seeing...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:43.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those kind of look like scallions,\Nbut they're bent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:45.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not sure what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.13,0:16:48.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But even if I'm not sure what they are,\NI know what I have to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.33,0:16:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to protect these fields\Nfrom those giant rabbits
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.83,0:16:52.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and any other beasts that live in this forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.21,0:16:56.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First, I'll build a fence around the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:17:00.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll dig a ditch around the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.63,0:17:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm still a little worried,\Nbut I feel a lot better having this built.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:08.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After a few days, the fence and\Nthe ditch were completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.67,0:17:11.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,During that time, I fed myself with\Nthe meat from another rabbit
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:13.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I killed when it tried charging into my fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.38,0:17:15.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder why they always\Ncharge in headfirst like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.79,0:17:17.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm what they're trying to\Nattack and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.63,0:17:22.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nature...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.13,0:17:25.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I water them with the watering pot\Nfrom the almighty farming tool,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.83,0:17:27.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they get bigger every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:31.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're growing a lot faster than normal plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.79,0:17:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm still not exactly sure what I'm growing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:36.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I hope it's stuff that I can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.88,0:17:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If they all turned out to be\Ndecorative plants...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:45.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that I'd fall to my knees in despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.04,0:17:47.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A few more days passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.79,0:17:51.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all my hard work,\NI was able to build a small hut.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.58,0:17:53.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I cut grooves into the wood\Nand stacked them on top of each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's basically a log house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.21,0:17:58.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Part of the way through I wasn't able to lift\Nthe lumber up to the top anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:02.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I dug out the ground a bit\Nto give myself more vertical space.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.04,0:18:05.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For the roof, I used bark from the trees
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and held it down with nails I made\Nfrom shaved down wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:09.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I was in a fairy-tale,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.88,0:18:12.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,a wolf would be able to huff and puff\Nand blow this house down,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.63,0:18:15.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I think this is a lot more civilized\Nthan living in a hole I dug into a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.96,0:18:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see how my crops turn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:24.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel really motivated lately,\Nand I've been looking forward to each new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.17,0:18:28.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was when I started to get into\Na routine with my new life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.13,0:18:33.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.33,0:18:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.21,0:18:38.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They don't seem like\Nthey're going to attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.46,0:18:41.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And they look like they're in\Npretty rough shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:48.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.88,0:18:52.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing. I just killed a boar
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and didn't know what to do\Nwith all the meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:58.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was trying to get over my fence,\Nso I had no choice but to exterminate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.67,0:19:01.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One of them has a swollen belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.08,0:19:04.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he was trying to take\Nthe pregnant one somewhere safe
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:06.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,when they were attacked by\Nsome other animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:11.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This reminds me of when I was a kid\Nand I wanted to get a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:14.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They say that dogs are a farmer's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'd be nice if they hung around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.13,0:19:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.58,0:19:25.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is she about to give birth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.29,0:19:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here? Now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.25,0:19:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.08,0:19:33.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, it's probably better\Nthan being outside
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I led them into my log house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:38.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How long does it take for dogs to give birth?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.42,0:19:40.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does she need water to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.13,0:19:44.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'll get colder once the sun sets.\NI should build a fire here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:45.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But that'll fill the room with smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.63,0:19:47.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can leave it just outside the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:56.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I tried doing everything\NI could think of to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.46,0:20:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I figured it wasn't good for a human\Nto be around, so I left them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:06.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope I didn't end up bothering them\Nby trying to help too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.29,0:20:11.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If that giant boar attacked while she was\Ngiving birth and unable to move...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.42,0:20:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It might be because of the light\Nfrom the fire next to the hut,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.79,0:20:19.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but everything else\Nlooks really dark tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.29,0:20:30.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I fell asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.79,0:20:48.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They look calm now that it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.04,0:20:50.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure she had a really tough night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.88,0:20:57.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To celebrate her giving birth, I cut up\Nthe tastiest looking parts from the boar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:21:03.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought the dogs would go off somewhere\Nafter she gave birth, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.42,0:21:05.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it looks like they're going to\Nhang around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.75,0:21:09.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Since it seems like they're\Nreally attached to that hut,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.29,0:21:11.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't bring myself to kick them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.21,0:21:12.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So I built myself a new house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.54,0:21:17.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like to think I've improved\Nsince the first home that I built.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:20.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the time the puppies were\Nold enough to start running around,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the plants were big enough for me\Nto start harvesting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.79,0:21:25.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These are tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:27.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Left alone, they grew into a tangled mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.21,0:21:32.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're pretty hard to harvest,\Nand they look kind of small.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.92,0:21:36.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But they're definitely tomatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.13,0:21:41.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The dogs do some hunting\Nand protect the premises for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.71,0:21:44.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, it's getting tricky\Njust calling them all "dogs",
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.67,0:21:46.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I decided to give them names.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:48.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The boy is Kuro. The girl is Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.75,0:21:50.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's got dark fur too, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.54,0:21:51.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kuro. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:56.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't think dogs would eat vegetables,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.21,0:21:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but seeing them enjoying\Nthe vegetables so much
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.25,0:22:02.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,makes me want to work harder to grow\Nbetter vegetables to feed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.00,0:22:06.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been pretty busy with\Nharvesting vegetables,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.46,0:22:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,which makes me want to shout with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.33,0:22:10.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll need to build a storehouse for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.88,0:22:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to build furniture and tools, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.38,0:22:15.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of stuff I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.88,0:22:20.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, there's no rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.25,0:22:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll take my time working at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.54,0:23:22.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want to cross the mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.29,0:23:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Listen miss, unless you're drunk,\Nyou really shouldn't be saying stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.79,0:23:29.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Haven't you heard of The Forest of Death?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.33,0:23:32.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what's on the other side of the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.38,0:23:34.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's full of dangerous monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.33,0:23:36.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If any of them ever came down here\Nand attacked us,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.63,0:23:39.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the town would need guards on duty 24/7.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.50,0:23:44.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That might be just what I'm looking for.
